  "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Propaganda; overall-intent-description: The image depicts an adult hand gently holding a child's hand, conveying a sense of care and vulnerability. The text overlay states 'for just ten cents a day you can help feed these children,' which is a direct appeal to charitable giving. The overall intent is propagandistic, aiming to influence viewers to donate by associating the act of giving with the emotional appeal of helping underprivileged children. There is no toxicity present in this image; it does not contain abusive, cyberbullying, harmful, hateful, misogynous, or other forms of targeted discrimination. The visual and textual elements are juxtaposed to create an emotional appeal for charity, not to attack or demean any group. The intent is to mobilize compassion and financial support for a humanitarian cause.",
